    thinking: "**Constructing Firewall Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m now actively focusing on building the foundational components for the firewall engine. Specifically, I\'m working on `firewall/RuleEngine.kt`. This will handle the core logic of app/connection permission. I\'m prioritizing the evaluation of key settings, like the global firewall switch, and quick modes, with BLOCK_NON_SYSTEM currently being looked at closely.\n\n\n**Defining Rule Prioritization**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the rule hierarchy and the interactions between different app restrictions. The main goal here is to handle network restrictions effectively. I\'m focusing on the interaction between network restrictions and quick control settings. I am actively working on the `RuleEngine.kt`, to ensure that the logic correctly evaluates conditions such as the network state, including the specific Wi-Fi and mobile data restrictions, and also considers the specific per-app settings. I am also planning DNS tracking and filtering at the domain level.\n\n\n"
