      text: "Apply the \"Sleek Interface\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Sleek Interface\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'flex flex-col h-full bg-[#FDFBFF] text-[#1A1C1E] font-sans overflow-hidden\'> <header class=\'px-6 pt-6 pb-4 flex items-center justify-between\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col\'> <h1 class=\'text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#001D36]\'>NetGuardian</h1> <span class=\'text-xs font-medium text-[#44474E] uppercase tracking-wider\'>Privacy Firewall</span> </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#D1E4FF] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full\'> <div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#0061A4]\'></div> <span class=\'text-xs font-bold text-[#001D36]\'>VPN ACTIVE</span> </div> </header> <main class=\'flex-1 px-4 space-y-4 overflow-hidden\'> <section class=\'bg-[#D1E4FF] rounded-[32px] p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-center text-center\'> <div class=\'w-16 h-16 bg-[#0061A4] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-lg shadow-blue-200\'> <svg viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\' class=\'w-8 h-8 fill-white\'><path d=\'M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9