also designed the full-width button with its specific styles for both the active and inactive cases.\n\n\\n\\n\n\nNow I\'m designing the `StatTilesSection`, making sure it matches the provided HTML specification. I am working through the tile\'s content, focusing on the font sizes, bold text styling, colors, and specific data labels, like \'Connections Stopped\'. I am ensuring the visual presentation aligns with the defined design framework.\n\n\n**Designing Stat Tiles**\n\nI\'m now focusing on a stat tile, ensuring its design mirrors the HTML specification. I\'m noting the white surface, rounded corners, and border style. I\'m focusing on the typography of the top label and the large number, especially color variations like sleek blue and rich red. I\'m paying careful attention to the data and subtitle, and ensuring the spacing and alignment are accurate. I will ensure the colors and font sizes match the design.\n\n\n\n"
