    modified_response: "The **Sleek Interface** design theme has been applied across all screens of **NetGuardian**:\n\n- **Design System & Palette**: Integrated the Sleek color system (`#FDFBFF` surface background, `#FFFFFF` crisp card containers, `#0061A4` deep primary accents, `#D1E4FF` tonal containers, and `#C2C7CF` subtle borders) across both light and dark theme configurations.\n- **Top Bar & Navigation**: Updated the main app header with sleek status chips and replaced standard navigation indicators with refined tonal pills and clear typography.\n- **Dashboard**: Modernized the hero status card, dynamic statistic tiles, quick-mode buttons, and architectural transparency card with crisp card geometry and clean typography.\n- **Apps Screen**: Styled search inputs, category filter chips, batch action toggles, per-app permission rows, and the granular rule configuration bottom sheet.\n- **Live Connection Logs**: Updated search fields, live inspection badges, block-rate summary bars, and individual packet event cards with high-contrast type and status tags.\n- **Privacy & Settings**: Unified DNS sinkholing cards, domain rules, and backup/restore dialogs with consistent borders and tonal styling.\n\nAll unit tests and project compilation passed with zero errors."
