  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Tab Structure**\n\nI\'ve decided to incorporate a TabRow at the top, allowing users to toggle between \"App Rules\" and \"Background Activity\" views. I\'m using a mutableStateOf to track the current tab, initializing it to 0 (App Rules). When the \"Background Activity\" tab is active, the dedicated content will show.\n\n\n**Elaborating the Guide**\n\nI\'m expanding the \"Background Activity\" section to include a detailed technical guide. It will begin with a Header Card titled \"Background Execution & Network Control,\" followed by a breakdown of Android OS restrictions across various versions, from Nougat to the latest releases. The guide will also address OEM behaviors, highlighting how manufacturers like Samsung, Xiaomi, Huawei, OnePlus, and Oppo manage background processes. I plan to clarify the non-root OS security barrier and explain how NetGuardian\'s VpnService operates at the IP socket layer.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 158870345
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
