  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Clarifying Firewall Messaging**\n\nI\'m focusing on the firewall startup prompt in `DashboardScreen.kt`. The current message \"FIREWALL STARTUP SAFETY: Before starting the VPN\" feels redundant and could be clearer. I\'m considering how to concisely inform the user about firewall initialization.\n\n\n**Refining Firewall Onboarding**\n\nI\'ve been working on a confirmation screen for first-time firewall activation. I\'m thinking of \"Start Firewall?\" with an explanation about Android traffic routing and local rule processing. The plan is to clearly signal ON status only after verifying the VPN is running successfully. I\'m also considering non-aggressive default rules to avoid immediate unexpected blocks and offering a quick setup option for user customization. Finally, I\'m working on explaining app access control within the App Manager.\n\n\n"
