    thinking: "**Constructing Protection Interface**\n\nI\'m now diving into the design of the \"Protection Setup\" and \"Permissions\" management screen. The focus is on implementing a permanent page under Settings, just as the instructions specified. I am focusing on the user interface and functionality needed.\n\n\n**Designing Protection Interface**\n\nI\'ve outlined a protection setup screen, mapping capabilities with status, description, and fix buttons. I am also implementing a confirmation for the VPN firewall startup, including explanations and checks. I will begin by creating `ProtectionSetupScreen.kt` in `ui/settings`.\n\n\n**Defining Protection Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing the individual elements of the `ProtectionSetupScreen`. Each item will have status, description, and action buttons. For the VPN Firewall, it can be \"Enabled,\" \"Authorized,\" or \"Not Authorized,\" and actions are \"Authorize\" or \"Start.\" Notifications\' status can be \"Enabled,\" \"Disabled,\" or \"Not Required,\" with a \"Configure/Fix\" action. I\'m focusing on the logic and user interaction for each component.\n\n\n"
