  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Notification Channels**\n\nI\'m currently focused on setting up the notification system. The priority now is defining the necessary channels. I\'ve begun to outline `FirewallNotificationManager.kt` and have identified the core channel for \"NetGuardian Protection\" with the ID `CHANNEL_PROTECTION`. I\'m starting to consider other channels that might be relevant later on as I work through the process.\n\n\n**Refining Notification Details**\n\nI\'ve been drilling down into the specifics of each notification type. I\'ve defined channels for \"NetGuardian Status\" and \"NetGuardian Alerts\" with their corresponding importance levels and descriptions, making sure they\'re accurately categorised. I am now working on crafting the persistent foreground notification\'s content, refining titles, text, and actions based on the firewall state. I am also planning the unexpected disconnect alert notification, which will be critical.\n\n\n"
