  planner_response {
    response: "I have finished testing, compiling, and refining the Quick Settings Tiles and persistent notification architecture for NetGuardian:\n\n- **Quick Settings Tile Implementation**: Registered and verified all 4 native Android `TileService` implementations (`FirewallTileService`, `BlockAllTileService`, `WifiOnlyTileService`, and `MobileDataTileService`) with real system icons and permission checks.\n- **Persistent Foreground Notification**: Integrated `FirewallNotificationManager` providing real-time firewall status, pause/resume controls, blocked application counts, and deep links into the app.\n- **Centralized State Repository**: `FirewallStateRepository` synchronizes firewall states (`RUNNING`, `PAUSED`, `STARTING`, `ERROR`, `STOPPED`) across the UI, notifications, and Quick Settings tiles.\n- **In-App Tile Management**: Added a discovery banner on the Dashboard and an interactive Quick Settings configuration guide in Settings with Android 13+ one-tap tile addition support."
    modified_response: "I have finished testing, compiling, and refining the Quick Settings Tiles and persistent notification architecture for NetGuardian:\n\n- **Quick Settings Tile Implementation**: Registered and verified all 4 native Android `TileService` implementations (`FirewallTileService`, `BlockAllTileService`, `WifiOnlyTileService`, and `MobileDataTileService`) with real system icons and permission checks.\n- **Persistent Foreground Notification**: Integrated `FirewallNotificationManager` providing real-time firewall status, pause/resume controls, blocked application counts, and deep links into the app.\n- **Centralized State Repository**: `FirewallStateRepository` synchronizes firewall states (`RUNNING`, `PAUSED`, `STARTING`, `ERROR`, `STOPPED`) across the UI, notifications, and Quick Settings tiles.\n- **In-App Tile Management**: Added a discovery banner on the Dashboard and an interactive Quick Settings configuration guide in Settings with Android 13+ one-tap tile addition support."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
