tent button mappings. I also reviewed `Step8OptionalPrivacyFeatures` and `PrivacyFeatureToggle`, confirming the consistent pattern, including `SleekPrimaryText`, `SleekMutedText`, `SleekBorder`, `SleekBodyText`, `SleekPrimary` and `SleekSurfaceVariant`.\n\n\n"
